From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:33:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-227: native tooltip lines, server aura amounts,
 ZepNativeTooltips()

- spell tooltips: movement speed lines, weapon-damage hit, 'Scales with', crit chance + crit hit
- buff/debuff tooltips use the server's effect amounts (SMSG_ZEP_AURA_AMOUNTS, reused 0x3A3) for
  any caster instead of bare base values
- Lua ZepNativeTooltips() lets the ZepTooltips addon go dormant on this client

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
